 At present, the company keeps in contact with its distributors through telephone and email, communicating confidential information about new products and prices. Distributors contact Orion&amp;#x27;s headquarters to communicate their queries or requirements, but responding to these questions is a time-consuming process. Orion wants to upgrade to a secure online system through which distributors can access information from the company and communicate their queries or complaints. Which of the following methods is most suited for this purpose?</mat_formattedtext></mat_extension></material></flow></flow><flow class="RESPONSE_BLOCK"><response_lid ident="response" rcardinality="Single" rtiming="No"><render_choice shuffle="No" minnumber="0" maxnumber="0"><flow_label class="Block"><response_label ident="5560140AB35C4F9BB9D1166EE0DF3A0A" shuffle="Yes" rarea="Ellipse" rrange="Exact"><flow_mat class="FORMATTED_TEXT_BLOCK"><material><mat_extension><mat_formattedtext type="HTML">An extranet</mat_formattedtext></mat_extension></material></flow_mat></response_label></flow_label><flow_label class="Block"><response_label ident="F6F7C2ECD630453DB61C226AB383B65C" shuffle="Yes" rarea="Ellipse" rrange="Exact"><flow_mat class="FORMATTED_TEXT_BLOCK"><material><mat_extension><mat_formattedtext type="HTML">Teleconferencing</mat_formattedtext></mat_extension></material></flow_mat></response_label></flow_label><flow_label class="Block"><response_label ident="2587E168AA314899B59FCF9A4056E288" shuffle="Yes" rarea="Ellipse" rrange="Exact"><flow_mat class="FORMATTED_TEXT_BLOCK"><material><mat_extension><mat_formattedtext type="HTML">Videoconferencing</mat_formattedtext></mat_extension></material></flow_mat></response_label></flow_label><flow_label class="Block"><response_label ident="E605412C7CB147C3869D2FF329166A00" shuffle="Yes" rarea="Ellipse" rrange="Exact"><flow_mat class="FORMATTED_TEXT_BLOCK"><material><mat_extension><mat_formattedtext type="HTML">Social networking</mat_formattedtext></ma