ew topics on the original thread; don&amp;#x27;t change threads.</mat_formattedtext></mat_extension></material></flow_mat></response_label></flow_label><flow_label class="Block"><response_label ident="6AA384EA37444644AFF6134E828A47A4" shuffle="Yes" rarea="Ellipse" rrange="Exact"><flow_mat class="FORMATTED_TEXT_BLOCK"><material><mat_extension><mat_formattedtext type="HTML">Use acronyms to save time and make it easier for readers to skim through.</mat_formattedtext></mat_extension></material></flow_mat></response_label></flow_label><flow_label class="Block"><response_label ident="8F445D1A41514B548917E657B1A5E5A0" shuffle="Yes" rarea="Ellipse" rrange="Exact"><flow_mat class="FORMATTED_TEXT_BLOCK"><material><mat_extension><mat_formattedtext type="HTML">Focus on the subject at hand, not on personal characteristics of respondents.</mat_formattedtext></mat_extension></material></flow_mat></response_label></flow_label><flow_label class="Block"><response_label ident="398BC307C00E438DA0F9F3452022FADC" shuffle="Yes" rarea="Ellipse" rrange="Exact"><flow_mat class="FORMATTED_TEXT_BLOCK"><material><mat_extension><mat_formattedtext type="HTML">In order to save time for readers, avoid providing supporting statements.</mat_formattedtext></mat_extension></material></flow_mat></response_label></flow_label></render_choice></response_lid></flow></flow></presentation><resprocessing scoremodel="SumOfScores"><outcomes><decvar varname="SCORE" vartype="Decimal" defaultval="0.0" minvalue="0.0" maxvalue="1.00"/></outcomes><respcondition title="correct"><conditionvar><varequal respident="response" case="No">8F445D1A41514B548917E657B1A5E5A0</varequal></conditionvar><setvar variablename="SCORE" action="Set">SCORE.max</setvar><displayfeedback linkrefid="correct" feedbacktype="Response"/></respcondition><respcondition title="incorrect"><conditionvar><other/></conditionvar><setvar variablename="SCORE" action="Set">0.0</setvar><displayfeedback linkrefid="incorrect" feedbacktype="Response"/></respcond